  "description": "Beautiful 2-Bedroom, 2-Bathroom Apartment in Foxrock, Dublin 18\n\nA bright, well-maintained two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment is available to rent in The Pines, Beckett Woods, Foxrock, Dublin 18.\n\nThe apartment offers a spacious and comfortable living environment with a well-proportioned layout throughout. It comprises a bright living area, fully fitted kitchen, two good-sized bedrooms and two bathrooms.\n\nThe property is ideal for tenants seeking a high-quality, long-term home in a quiet, established residential setting.\nThe apartment is presented in excellent condition and offers a comfortable combination of space, privacy and convenience.\n\nKey Features\n- Two spacious bedrooms\n- Two bathrooms\n- Bright and comfortable living area\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Excellent storage\n- Well-maintained apartment\n- Attractive residential development\n- Long-term letting available\n\nReferences and supporting documentation may be required.\n**Viewing strictly by appointment. **",
